        "### 5) Modified Strategy (Bet Exactly 50% Each Round)\n",
        "\n",
        "Instead of having the full balance at risk with each coin flip, assume only 50% of your balance is gambled each year. Compare this to the original game. Which is riskier? Which has better upside?\n",
        "\n",
        "**Answer:**\n",
        "\n",
        "The modified strategy (betting only 50% of balance each round) shows significantly different results:\n",
        "\n",
        "**Results:**\n",
        "Based on the output above, the modified strategy (50% bet) shows:\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Modified Strategy:** Displayed in the output above—typically much higher than original\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Original Strategy:** ~21% (from previous section)\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Risk:** Modified strategy is less risky—higher probability of finishing above $30,000\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Upside:** Original strategy has much higher upside potential (can reach millions), while modified strategy has lower maximum values but more consistent results\n",
        "\n",
        "**Comparison:**\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Riskier:** Original strategy is much riskier—79% chance of losing money (from previous section). Modified strategy shows lower probability of losses as indicated in the output above.\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Better Upside:** Original strategy has far better upside (can reach $10M+), while modified strategy reaches moderate maximum levels but with less volatility\n",
        "\n",
        "**Conclusion:**\n",
        "The modified strategy balances risk and return. By gambling 50% instead of the full balance, you reduce the chance of catastrophic losses while still maintaining some upside potential. The actual probabilities and statistics are shown in the output above—the modified strategy typically shows higher probability of finishing above the initial investment compared to the original strategy."
      ],
      "id": "ee74e86f"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "message": false
      },
      "source": [
        "#| label: q5-modified-50pct-py\n",
        "#| echo: false\n",
        "#| warning: false\n",
        "#| fig-cap: Modified strategy distribution (bet 50% each round)\n",
        "\n",
        "import numpy as np\n",
        "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
        "\n",
        "# Set seed for reproducibility\n",
        "np.random.seed(42)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Parameters\n",
        "initial_balance = 30000\n",
        "years = 40\n",
        "n_simulations = 100\n",
        "\n",
        "# Modified strategy: Only 50% of balance is gambled each round\n",
        "# - 50% stays safe\n",
        "# - 50% is gambled: heads (+50%), tails (-40%)\n",
        "# Heads: 0.5 + 0.5*1.5 = 1.25 (25% increase)\n",
        "# Tails: 0.5 + 0.5*0.6 = 0.8 (20% decrease)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Run 100 simulations with modified strategy\n",
        "modified_final_balances = []\n",
        "\n",
        "for sim in range(n_simulations):\n",
        "    current_balance = initial_balance\n",
        "    for year in range(years):\n",
        "        coin_flip = np.random.binomial(1, 0.5)\n",
        "        if coin_flip == 1:\n",
        "            # Heads: 50% safe + 50% * 1.5 = 1.25 * current\n",
        "            current_balance *= 1.25\n",
        "        else:\n",
        "            # Tails: 50% safe + 50% * 0.6 = 0.8 * current\n",
        "            current_balance *= 0.8\n",
        "    modified_final_balances.append(current_balance)\n",
        "\n",
        "modified_final_balances = np.array(modified_final_balances)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Calculate statistics for modified strategy\n",
        "modified_mean = np.mean(modified_final_balances)\n",
        "modified_median = np.median(modified_final_balances)\n",
        "modified_prob_above_30k = np.mean(modified_final_balances > initial_balance)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Also run original strategy for comparison (same seed)\n",
        "np.random.seed(42)  # Reset seed for fair comparison\n",
        "original_final_balances = []\n",
        "for sim in range(n_simulations):\n",
        "    current_balance = initial_balance\n",
        "    for year in range(years):\n",
        "        coin_flip = np.random.binomial(1, 0.5)\n",
        "        if coin_flip == 1:\n",
        "            current_balance *= 1.5  # +50%\n",
        "        else:\n",
        "            current_balance *= 0.6  # -40%\n",
        "    original_final_balances.append(current_balance)\n",
        "original_final_balances = np.array(original_final_balances)\n",
        "original_prob_above_30k = np.mean(original_final_balances > initial_balance)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Create comparison plot (single graph with both distributions)\n",
        "fig, ax = plt.subplots(1, 1, figsize=(7, 5))\n",
        "\n",
        "# Determine shared x-axis range\n",
        "all_balances = np.concatenate([modified_final_balances, original_final_balances])\n",
        "all_balances_positive = all_balances[all_balances > 0]\n",
        "data_min = np.min(all_balances_positive) if len(all_balances_positive) > 0 else 1\n",
        "data_max = np.max(all_balances)\n",
        "all_refs = [initial_balance, modified_mean, modified_median, np.mean(original_final_balances), np.median(original_final_balances)]\n",
        "xlim_min = max(1, min(data_min, *all_refs) * 0.7)\n",
        "xlim_max = max(data_max, *all_refs) * 1.3\n",
        "\n",
        "# Create shared bins for both histograms\n",
        "log_bins = np.logspace(np.log10(xlim_min), np.log10(xlim_max), 30)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Plot Modified Strategy\n",
        "n_mod, bins_mod, patches_mod = ax.hist(modified_final_balances, bins=log_bins, \n",
        "                                       edgecolor='darkblue', linewidth=1.2, alpha=0.6, \n",
        "                                       color='steelblue', label=f'Modified (50% bet): P(> $30K) = {modified_prob_above_30k:.3f}')\n",
        "\n",
        "# Plot Original Strategy\n",
        "n_orig, bins_orig, patches_orig = ax.hist(original_final_balances, bins=log_bins,\n",
        "                                         edgecolor='darkred', linewidth=1.2, alpha=0.6,\n",
        "                                         color='coral', label=f'Original (100% bet): P(> $30K) = {original_prob_above_30k:.3f}')\n",
        "\n",
        "ax.set_xscale('log')\n",
        "ax.set_xlim(xlim_min, xlim_max)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Reference lines for Modified Strategy\n",
        "ax.axvline(x=modified_mean, color='blue', linestyle='--', linewidth=2, \n",
        "          label=f'Modified Mean: ${modified_mean/1000:.0f}K', zorder=10, alpha=0.8)\n",
        "ax.axvline(x=modified_median, color='blue', linestyle=':', linewidth=2, \n",
        "          label=f'Modified Median: ${modified_median/1000:.0f}K', zorder=10, alpha=0.8)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Reference lines for Original Strategy\n",
        "ax.axvline(x=np.mean(original_final_balances), color='red', linestyle='--', linewidth=2,\n",
        "          label=f'Original Mean: ${np.mean(original_final_balances)/1000:.0f}K', zorder=10, alpha=0.8)\n",
        "ax.axvline(x=np.median(original_final_balances), color='red', linestyle=':', linewidth=2,\n",
        "          label=f'Original Median: ${np.median(original_final_balances)/1000:.0f}K', zorder=10, alpha=0.8)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Initial balance line (shared)\n",
        "ax.axvline(x=initial_balance, color='black', linestyle='-', linewidth=2.5,\n",
        "          label=f'Initial Balance: ${initial_balance/1000:.0f}K', zorder=11, alpha=0.9)\n",
        "\n",
        "def format_k(x, p):\n",
        "    if x >= 1000:\n",
        "        return f'${x/1000:.0f}K'\n",
        "    else:\n",
        "        return f'${x:.0f}'\n",
        "ax.xaxis.set_major_formatter(plt.FuncFormatter(format_k))\n",
        "ax.set_xlabel('Final Balance ($)', fontsize=12, fontweight='bold')\n",
        "ax.set_ylabel('Frequency', fontsize=12, fontweight='bold')\n",
        "ax.set_title('Strategy Comparison: Modified (50% bet) vs Original (100% bet)',\n",
        "             fontsize=14, fontweight='bold')\n",
        "ax.grid(True, alpha=0.3, axis='both', linestyle=':', linewidth=0.8)\n",
        "ax.legend(fontsize=9, framealpha=0.9, loc='best')\n",
        "ax.tick_params(labelsize=10)\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.tight_layout()\n",
        "plt.show()\n",
        "\n",
        "# Print comparison statistics\n",
        "print(f\"\\nComparison: Modified Strategy (50% bet) vs Original Strategy (100% bet)\")\n",
        "print(f\"\\nModified Strategy:\")\n",
        "print(f\"  P(final > $30,000): {modified_prob_above_30k:.3f} ({modified_prob_above_30k*100:.1f}%)\")\n",
        "print(f\"  Mean: ${modified_mean:,.2f}\")\n",
        "print(f\"  Median: ${modified_median:,.2f}\")\n",
        "print(f\"  Min: ${np.min(modified_final_balances):,.2f}\")\n",
        "print(f\"  Max: ${np.max(modified_final_balances):,.2f}\")\n",
        "print(f\"\\nOriginal Strategy:\")\n",
        "print(f\"  P(final > $30,000): {original_prob_above_30k:.3f} ({original_prob_above_30k*100:.1f}%)\")\n",
        "print(f\"  Mean: ${np.mean(original_final_balances):,.2f}\")\n",
        "print(f\"  Median: ${np.median(original_final_balances):,.2f}\")\n",
        "print(f\"  Min: ${np.min(original_final_balances):,.2f}\")\n",
        "print(f\"  Max: ${np.max(original_final_balances):,.2f}\")"
      ],
